@startuml
title Video Suggestion System UML State Machine Diagram

state StartChoice <<choice>>
state UserChoice <<choice>>
state GatherVideos <<action>>
state AddDetails <<action>>
state SendVideos <<action>>

[*] --> UserChoice

UserChoice --> GatherVideos : [user suggestion request received]
GatherVideos --> AddDetails
AddDetails --> SendVideos
SendVideos --> End : [suggested videos sent to user]
@enduml
